tools/ghidra_*/
__pycache__/

# Packaging (docs/systems/releases.md): the packages and their working folders are in out/;
# tools/package.ps1 puts the .sln beside each Godot project for the export and removes it.
src/*/*.sln
# The branding is art, which is kept in the private repository (ADR 0041): its make.py, or
# tools/package.ps1 -Branding, puts the projects' icon and boot splash here.
src/*/icon.png
src/*/icon.ico
src/*/icon.icns
src/*/splash.png
# Godot writes a .uid beside each C# script when its editor scans a project. Nothing here
# refers to a script by UID: the scenes name them by path.
*.cs.uid

# Local launchers and scratch, such as dev/party-animation-ring.cmd (docs/systems/runtime.md).
dev/
# The shortcut Launch ACRE.cmd makes beside itself, with the ACRE icon: absolute paths, so each clone makes its own.
Launch ACRE.lnk
